# Ruleset: Downloads
#
# Expects DIRECT.
#
# Netdisk fronts, OS and game content CDNs, and update and object storage hosts that work on the direct path. Steam and Nintendo delivery hosts follow the same policy for game downloads. Microsoft delivery lives in Platforms/MicrosoftCDN.list.
#
# The 1Password, iStat Menus and PopClip update hosts answer slowly on the direct path, so they reach a proxy through FINAL.

# Quark
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,quark.cn

# Alipan
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alipan.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aliyundrive.com

# Baidu Netdisk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,baidupcs.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pan.baidu.com

# Cloudflare
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflarestorage.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,r2.dev

# Backblaze
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,backblazeb2.com

# OrbStack
DOMAIN,api-updates.orbstack.dev
DOMAIN,cdn-updates.orbstack.dev

# Steam
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,steamcontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,steampipe.akamaized.net

# Nintendo
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cdn.nintendo.net

# Setapp
DOMAIN,store.setapp.com

# 123pan
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,123pan.com

# Lanzou
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,lanzoui.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,lanzoux.com

# Xunlei
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,thunderurl.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xunlei.com

# Wenshushu
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wenshushu.cn

# Weiyun
